      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i feel really weird and shaky all of a sudden and im kinda sweaty too. my blood sugar was actually a bit high like an hour ago so i think it's just crashing back down. should i just take an extra unit of my rapid insulin now to keep it from spiking again or will that make it worse?",
